# Feature cycle (D33)

Canon: `docs/knowledge/feature-cycle.md`.

```text
idea → analysis → plan (required) → implement → test → re-analyze → fix
  → deploy (Vercel Hobby) → KB update
```

**Stops:** no KB plan → no code (typo/one-line copy: 3 bullets in PR still naming cycle steps). No KB update → task not closed.

Deploy: merge `main` → Hobby; migrate separately from build; no second Postgres for prod UI.
